{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2ndl29s2","type":"work","title":"掌銓題稿","authors":[{"name":"高拱","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9be2e","cbdb_id":30847,"cbdb_match":"auto","cbdb_source":"name_exact+birth_1510_death_1578+work_exact(掌銓題稿)+unique"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《掌銓題稿》•十四卷","author_info":"明高拱撰","summary":"明高拱撰。拱於隆慶己巳複召入內閣，兼掌吏部事者凡二年。是編皆其疏稿也。史稱拱在吏部，欲遍識人材，授諸司以籍，使署賢否，志爵裏姓氏，月要而歲會之。倉卒舉用，無不得人。蓋其才固有足取者矣。","edition":"安徽巡撫采進本"}],"juan_count":{"number":14},"resources":[{"id":"archive_org","name":"Internet Archive 影印本","url":"https://archive.org/details/zhongguo-mingchao-dangan-zonghui-vol079","volumes":[{"volume":79,"url":"https://archive.org/details/zhongguo-mingchao-dangan-zonghui-vol079","status":"found"}],"expected_volumes":1,"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Harvard_drs_44313395_%E6%8E%8C%E9%8A%93%E9%A1%8C%E7%A8%BF_v.1.pdf"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":14}],"measure_info":"十四卷","contained_in":[{"id":"8rlcsybg2hhj","volume_index":"第79冊"}],"updated_at":"2026-08-09T10:41:40+00:00","_has_text":false,"_has_image":true,"_has_collated":true,"period":"ming","period_basis":"據 authors[0].dynasty「明」","dynasty":"明","dynasty_basis":"author_propagation","ai_note":"[ming-round1: author.dynasty 集合=['明'] → dynasty=明]\n\n2026-08-24 J11 description 撮自本條所繫之著錄：本欄之文由撰人、卷數、著錄諸志、志按所稱之佚文出處與輯家、存佚五節綴成，**每節皆據本條 indexed_by 之引文，不出其外，亦不臆造**。凡著錄所無者一字不書。此即 curate-dynasty S3〈借力志書〉之法——本時段有姚振宗《三國藝文志》與丁國鈞《補晉書藝文志》二部斷代志之整理本在庫，其按語備載卷數異同、佚文出處與輯家，正可為佚書之 desc 所本。**未覆核原書**。","description":{"text":"高拱（明）撰。十四卷。見著錄於《欽定四庫全書總目》。本書惟《欽定四庫全書總目》一志著錄，別無他證。《欽定四庫全書總目》清乾隆間館臣修——本書之目賴之以存。","sources":["欽定四庫全書總目"]},"revision":"1.0.1","revised_at":"2026-09-07","has_collated":true,"has_image":true,"_path":"Work/9/s/2/d59f2ndl29s2-掌銓題稿.json","_isDraft":false}